tt-local-generator (0.60.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * ui(generate): when the inference server on port 8000 isn't running, native
    generation now shows an actionable "start the server from the Servers menu"
    message instead of a raw HTTPConnectionPool traceback (worker._server_down_hint,
    applied to the image-gen and submit error paths).
  * NOTE: AnimateDiff Create still routes through the native IMAGE worker
    (ImageGenerationWorker) rather than AnimateDiffGenerationWorker / the local
    plugin — a routing bug flagged for follow-up (needs the intended-flow call).

